  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Desarrollo Municipal de Porto Alegre</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Municipal Development of Porto Alegre</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THIS PROGRAM AIMS TO MODERNIZE THE MUNICIPAL ADMINISTRATION AND TO IMPROVE AND EXPAND THE DELIVERY OF BASIC SERVICES TO THE POPULATION OF PORTO ALEGRE. IT INCLUDES THREE SUB-PROGRAMS: 1) MODERNIZATION OF MUNICIPAL ADMINISTRATION (DECENTRALIZATION; TAX AND FINANCIAL ADMINISTRATION; STRENGTHENING OF MUNICIPAL MECHANISMS OF INTERNAL CONTROL); 2) INSTITUTIONAL STRENGTHENING OF MUNICIPAL UNITS; AND 3) IMPROVEMENT AND AMPLIATION OF BASIC URBAN INFRASTRUCTURE.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
